# The whole project is LF on disk and the harness depends on it: `git apply` refuses CRLF
# patches, and a checkout that silently rewrites line endings would make every diff differ
# from the artifact it was produced from. Failures here are quiet, so declare it once.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Task fixtures are byte-exact artifacts: a patch must apply to the same bytes that were
# captured, so never let git normalise them.
*.patch -text
tasks/fixtures/** -text

*.docx binary
*.png binary
